# The release runbook: local paths and hosts, never published.
build and push.md
# Working documents at the top of the folder stay here, whatever their name: the README is the only one published.
/*.md
!/README.md
# Review archives made from this folder.
/autoheal-review-*.tar.gz
# The retired Python watcher, kept on this machine only.
/autoheal-python-watcher-*.tar.gz
# certs/ holds only its README: the CA, keys and certificates it describes stay on your machine.
certs/*
!certs/README.md
# Folders that coding tools make next to the project; .aws/ would hold credentials.
.agents/
.aws/
.codex/
